  "body": "## What's Changed\r\n* Add badge to README.md by @noborus in https://github.com/noborus/mdtsql/pull/13\r\n* update modules 20240420 by @noborus in https://github.com/noborus/mdtsql/pull/14\r\n* update modules 20241221 by @noborus in https://github.com/noborus/mdtsql/pull/15\r\n* Add support for fallback analyze by @noborus in https://github.com/noborus/mdtsql/pull/16\r\n* Output complete by @noborus in https://github.com/noborus/mdtsql/pull/17\r\n* Update modules 20250527 by @noborus in https://github.com/noborus/mdtsql/pull/18\r\n* update modules 20250831 by @noborus in https://github.com/noborus/mdtsql/pull/19\r\n* update modules to latest versions by @noborus in https://github.com/noborus/mdtsql/pull/20\r\n* Bump filippo.io/edwards25519 from 1.1.0 to 1.1.1 by @dependabot[bot] in https://github.com/noborus/mdtsql/pull/21\r\n* Update go version and dependencies by @noborus in https://github.com/noborus/mdtsql/pull/22\r\n* Update dependencies and modernize code by @noborus in https://github.com/noborus/mdtsql/pull/23\r\n* Update GoReleaser and GitHub Actions versions by @noborus in https://github.com/noborus/mdtsql/pull/24\r\n* Add binary and package installation instructions to README.md by @noborus in https://github.com/noborus/mdtsql/pull/25\r\n* Do not use TAP_GITHUB_TOKEN for uploading Homebrew tap formulae by @noborus in https://github.com/noborus/mdtsql/pull/26\r\n\r\n## New Contributors\r\n* @dependabot[bot] made their first contribution in https://github.com/noborus/mdtsql/pull/21\r\n\r\n**Full Changelog**: https://github.com/noborus/mdtsql/compare/v0.1.0...v0.2.0",
